          <li><a href="/iot-solutions/">For Internet of Things</a></li>
          <li><a href="/mvne/">For Connectivity Providers</a></li>
          <li><a href="/travel-esim/">Travel eSIM</a></li>
          <li><a href="/finance-and-hr/">Finance and HR Teams</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ai-phone-number/">Phone Service for AI Agents</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Resources column -->
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4 class="footer-col-heading">Resources</h4>
        <ul class="footer-links">
          <li><a href="/blog/">Blog</a></li>
          <li><a href="/faq/">FAQ</a></li>
          <li><a href="/mvno-calculator/">MVNO Launch Cost Calculator</a></li>
          <li><a href="/unlimited-data-plans-pricing/">US Mobile Plans</a></li>
